tem information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta7 - Debian GNU/Linux 12 (bookworm) 12 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Single-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon R7 360 Series (RADV BONAIRE) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-3450 CPU @ 3.10GHz (4 threads) - 7.69 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen calling `EditorInterface::edit_script()` with `line` argument set to 1, the script editor doesn't jump to the first line. It works correctly with line 2 or higher, but not line 1.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open MRP\n2. Open `node_3d.tscn` scene\n3. Click on the root node\n4. In the inspector, click \"Jump to line\" tool button\n5. Switch to the script editor\n6. In the script editor, change the caret position to a line other than 1\n7. Click \"Jump to line\" tool button again\n\nExpected behavior:\nThe caret jumps to the first line of the script\n\nCurrent behavior:\nThe caret stays on the same line as before\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[edit-script-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22066471/edit-script-test.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":f